Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.42,0:00:15.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,This isn't good...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:19.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,This photoshoot could be over at any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:21.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:24.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,If she does that,\Neveryone will go home before we're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:02:02.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(448,403.2)}{\an7}Mayura vs. Nagomi!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:12.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, can I have a couple more minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:12.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.83,0:02:15.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kai-sama's still not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.13,0:02:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I understand you want to see him,\Nbut you need to be a professional!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.04,0:02:24.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're not a regular cosplayer anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:27.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Nagomi-chan's almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:29.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wanna check out the booths?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.83,0:02:31.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,We could see what other cosplayers are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:33.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah, let's head out before the station gets crowded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:36.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!\NWe can't let everyone go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.46,0:02:39.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But are we really gonna be able to stop them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.17,0:02:44.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We have to try, or we're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.21,0:02:48.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here she comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:10.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lustalotte?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.08,0:03:11.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:12.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's Mayura!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.46,0:03:13.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.25,0:03:14.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,She didn't even announce it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:18.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayuri? How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.83,0:03:22.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Neighbors again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.71,0:03:23.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, small world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we're all sold out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:28.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura-sama's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.13,0:03:29.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura-chan?! For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:40.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought she ghosted everyone and retired...\NI'm not letting her steal my spotlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:43.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fine, then, you're on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-chan's stripping down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.13,0:03:45.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:47.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-chan's still going!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.29,0:03:48.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's space for Nagomi pics!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:50.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:52.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? Nagomi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:58.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mayura...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.79,0:04:01.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's you and me, just like old times!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.42,0:04:03.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll show you what a professional can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:18.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's Mayura-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:20.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,And she's in the cosplay she teased!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.83,0:04:24.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance to get pics of Icola!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dammit, I don't know who to go to!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:30.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know where to start, it's all so crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:38.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I've got to find the logic here.\NThis might be the only time I see this happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:39.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's so crazy about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:44.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,The second they started snapping photos,\Nthe Mayuri-sensei I know just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:52.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her face, her expression, her posture...\NIt's all different.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.50,0:04:55.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's a different person.\NThat's the best way I can put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:04:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's like she's actually become her character.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.29,0:05:01.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is how I pay back my debts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:06.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,To the world that supported me every step of the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,To Lustalotte, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:12.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.17,0:05:16.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,To the next generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:23.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not bad, Mayura.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:29.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've changed... No, you haven't.\NThis is what always happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:35.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's just Lustalotte.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.33,0:05:39.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You outdid me again today...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:41.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how popular you are, Mayura.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.29,0:05:44.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lustalotte's popular, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:47.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad everyone can tell how much I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.13,0:05:52.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,She never made it about herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:56.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,To her, cosplay was all about the character.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:06:02.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,And she was always so confident,\Nas if she was sure that was the right way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:08.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know better than anyone that\NI've got tons of emotional baggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.42,0:06:12.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think I'm the best, I only care about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.33,0:06:15.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yet I still I can't accept myself for who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:20.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you have to love a character to cosplay them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:27.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ugh, if I wasn't cosplaying right now,\NI'd throw a tantrum and scream!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.25,0:06:33.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura, you have no idea how lucky\Nyou are to be worshipped like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.25,0:06:35.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,And that infuriates me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.38,0:06:41.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you know how much skill it takes,\Nhow much luck you need,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:43.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,to be able to pour so much love\Ninto something other than yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.54,0:06:48.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't make myself become someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:51.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who loves Kai-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:55.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm the pathetic otaku who wants his attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:59.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm the reason I want to be 2D.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.29,0:07:03.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm the reason I've put everything I have into cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:10.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,The love I have for myself is more pure\Nand powerful than anything else!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:15.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong, Mayura?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:19.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look at you. Stalwart as ever, Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:22.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it. It's really Mayuri-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:24.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Two of the Heavenly Queens, side-by-side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.38,0:07:25.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Somebody pinch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:28.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-the crowd's not thinning...\NIt just keeps growing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.83,0:07:31.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take a good look at this, milord Okumura.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:33.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,See this rivalry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:36.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is where we want to take our cosplayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:37.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.29,0:07:42.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Straight to the pinnacle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:50.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,My eyes are still red from crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:54.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,My Liliel cosplay won't be perfect today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:56.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,But that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:08:00.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're Ririsa Amano!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:04.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love cosplay. I love Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:06.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,And that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:08.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,So smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.25,0:08:12.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.42,0:08:16.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I might plaster one over my lips,\Nbut I'm never smiling inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm giving it my all, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.25,0:08:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,But whenever Mayura's here,\NI get swallowed up by this frustration...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:26.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,...that almost makes me want to quit altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:32.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,She keeps stealing more and more of my crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.17,0:08:36.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm doing cosplays no one could even get close to doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:39.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,So why am I still not number one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.38,0:08:45.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Am I doing something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:49.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love cosplaying so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:52.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,So why does it hurt so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi... I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.63,0:09:01.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(832,180)}{\an7}Street Cosplay\N{\pos(819.2,230.4)}{\an7}Fair Registration
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:02.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:04.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can we get a picture with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:08.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We cosplayed last year for\NHalloween and it was so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:10.29,Q3,,0,0,0,,Woof, they obviously bought those
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:10.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is our first time coming to an event!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.29,0:09:11.38,Q3,,0,0,0,,outfits at a discount shop...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.29,0:09:11.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is our first time coming to an event!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:11.96,Q3,,0,0,0,,outfits at a discount shop...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:13.38,Q3,,0,0,0,,Better avoid eye contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:14.38,Q3,,0,0,0,,Better avoid eye contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:14.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.04,0:09:17.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,We gotta be cosplay friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.67,0:09:24.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You didn't care if they were newbies in\Ncrap cosplay or influencers messing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:28.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You were just happy to see more people cosplaying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:30.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're going pro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, an agency reached out to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.96,0:09:35.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make a career out of cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.75,0:09:39.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll get to do the thing I love for ever and ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.04,0:09:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you want in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.29,0:09:42.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I'm good...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:46.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm planning on quitting eventually...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:52.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know you. I know how much you love cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.79,0:09:55.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know how much you've put into cosplaying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:10:01.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,And yeah, I know how you feel about me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:06.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But that's only because I'm your identical shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:09.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I felt jealous of you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:13.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay was always just a fun hobby for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:19.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,So sometimes, I saw you, and felt sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.17,0:10:21.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because I could tell...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.63,0:10:24.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,...that you never gave yourself\Nany credit for what you achieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.38,0:10:29.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san, what's got you so frantic?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:33.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You were so worried about your shadow,\Nyou couldn't see how brightly you shone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.25,0:10:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You sold more than me,\Nyou drew bigger crowds than me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:44.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura's doing better than me...\NI have to be the best, but I'm losing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.96,0:10:50.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You gave more of yourself to\Ncosplay than anyone else ever could.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why every comment crushed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.83,0:11:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You had to steel your heart\Nand fight back to protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.58,0:11:07.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I understand. I did the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:10.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,If we weren't rivals, I bet we'd be best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:14.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,We both worked so hard to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.29,0:11:20.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why isn't it enough just to love what we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.25,0:11:23.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why can't it be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:26.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I ask because I finally remembered...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:28.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,...how I used to feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm a cosplayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:36.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,When I first started cosplaying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.38,0:11:44.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mayura-sama's done?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.13,0:11:46.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way! I was just gonna head over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.17,0:11:47.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aw, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:49.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura's leaving?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:53.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why?! Does she feel bad for me or something?\NI don't need her pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:56.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's all from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.25,0:12:01.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll probably be upset with me,\Nbut I didn't ever want to pick a fight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:06.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you know, Nagomi... I don't think you did, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:10.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's someone I want you to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.92,0:12:15.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,And something I want you to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:27.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You see, her cosplay's nothing like yours.\NYou've got a brand-new character...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:32.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,...but everyone will know hers the second they see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:36.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,She picked her character because she loves her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:41.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's an old character you don't\Nsee at cosplay events anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:51.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I'll bet that everyone here,\Nat one time, had a crush...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.96,0:12:56.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,...on this angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:02.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:06.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:17.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Egads! That's Liliel's Chaos Form!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.50,0:13:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's the form she obtained\Nwhen she went in pursuit of power,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:23.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,got sucked into the darkness,\Nthen learned how to control it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.71,0:13:26.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.50,0:13:28.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You showed up after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:33.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd scared you,\Nso how are you out here like it's nothing at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:36.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid, or ignorant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:41.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,If she was, she wouldn't intentionally\Ncome straight towards my spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.54,0:13:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I can see her eyes are still red from crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.83,0:13:51.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,She was hurt, but she stood right back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:57.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then she came straight for me to pick a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:03.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's so cool...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.38,0:14:17.92,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,57.6)}{\an7}HURRY HURRY HURRY
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.38,0:14:15.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I gotta get changed so I can get pics!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:20.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.67,0:14:22.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.83,0:14:24.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That takes me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:25.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who's she?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:26.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's pretty cute though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:29.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is she here for pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.83,0:14:32.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've gotta go help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.33,0:14:32.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for pictures, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.54,0:14:46.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.42,0:14:51.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.17,0:14:53.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:55.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel? Who's the cosplayer? Is she cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.42,0:14:57.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't see her from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:14:58.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayura-sama left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.17,0:14:59.92,Q3,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect them to crowd around,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.17,0:14:59.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,We might as well do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:01.29,Q3,,0,0,0,,but I expected more...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:01.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll wait for Nagomi-chan to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.29,0:15:04.38,Q3,,0,0,0,,Guess it's because she's new.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.63,0:15:09.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,An old character's not gonna get much buzz,\Nbut might as well get a picture...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:16.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:20.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's the right reason to cosplay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:25.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,There IS no right reason.\NMayura-sama and Senpai taught me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:28.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I keep thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.04,0:15:32.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I still don't know if that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.67,0:15:37.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe there IS a reason,\Nand no one's stumbled upon it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:41.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I don't need to find the answer right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:48.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can keep looking, keep thinking,\Nand keep cosplaying all the while!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.92,0:15:50.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,No more hesitating!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.50,0:15:53.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.00,0:15:57.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:05.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,She is truly one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.58,0:16:11.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know Ririsa's not stuck in her head anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:14.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,...because right now,\Nshe gets to be her darling Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.38,0:16:17.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that Liliel is super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:20.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?! You're right!\NWhere'd she come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go check her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.58,0:16:25.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, could we form a crowd instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.46,0:16:26.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,If that's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.54,0:16:27.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where did all these guys come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:32.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yes, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:39.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that what you call a crowd?!\NDon't make me laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.25,0:16:41.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mine is exponentially bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:45.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm the best in the world,\Nand I love cosplay more than anyone out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.88,0:16:47.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm better!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.67,0:16:50.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,So why... Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.58,0:16:51.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why do you look like...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.13,0:16:55.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,you're still having so much fun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:17:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi... You'll know it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:04.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I think you already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.50,0:17:08.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,She didn't come here to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:11.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,None of us did when we started.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:15.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,She came here to cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.54,0:17:19.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:21.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:26.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I saw her at the event the other day.\NLook how cute she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.21,0:17:31.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,The first time I saw her picture, I hated her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.50,0:17:34.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew I shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:37.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.71,0:17:41.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should love every cosplayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.42,0:17:46.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,But now that you're here in front of me,\NI finally understand why I reacted that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.54,0:17:51.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because I had that same smile\Non my face a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.42,0:17:59.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tohka, I'm in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kai-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:02.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,My battery died!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.33,0:18:09.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's what I look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:12.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hate it.\NThat's why I threw out all my mirrors!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:18.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know it's all fiction.\NKai-sama would never fall in love with someone like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.00,0:18:20.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I can't just give up on him like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.33,0:18:23.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't find my coat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.17,0:18:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll just be like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:33.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll make fiction my reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:37.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,My first mirror in three years...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.88,0:18:44.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.13,0:18:46.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You look just like Fuyu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.38,0:18:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.38,0:18:52.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right! I just wanted to look cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:56.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to be better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:19:00.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was just so happy someone thought I was cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:03.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I started to like myself more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.13,0:19:07.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That had never happened before,\Nnot in my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplaying was fun.\NWhen I was in cosplay, I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.42,0:19:19.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be able to cosplay forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.71,0:19:25.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,But if I wanted to enjoy those happy hours forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.96,0:19:31.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,...I'd need to fight through hardship,\Nconflict, and malice to get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.83,0:19:39.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eventually, I had to wall off\Nmy heart just to protect myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:44.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to do what I loved as long as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.63,0:19:46.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Long ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.71,0:19:50.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I really believed that every\Ncosplayer was my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.50,0:19:52.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I loved them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:57.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,But now, cosplay hurts,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:20:01.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,and no matter how much\NI said I loved everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.63,0:20:06.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,...I hated seeing people just having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.71,0:20:13.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where did I go wrong? What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.67,0:20:20.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,No. I think I just forgot something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.17,0:20:23.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,The most important thing of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.96,0:20:32.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:40.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,If there is a god of cosplay,\Nwho would she smile upon: me, or Liliel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.88,0:20:43.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I already know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.29,0:20:45.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is Nagomi-chan done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.75,0:20:46.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Awww!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.79,0:20:48.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is she not feeling good?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.33,0:20:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wasn't in the zone at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:55.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I went over the cut-off time.\NI'm no professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:56.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.13,0:21:00.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope my little stunt didn't hurt her...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.75,0:21:04.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay! We can make it if we hurry back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.21,0:21:06.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:10.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not done. I need a little more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:11.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:18.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,If there is a god of cosplay...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.88,0:21:25.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,...I'm going to make her...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.25,0:21:28.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,...smile upon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.83,0:21:33.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not going down like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:36.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not when I finally get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.29,0:21:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you see me, Kai-sama?\NLook how cute I am now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone, look at me!\NLook at how cute I am now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:53.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew you were tough, Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:55.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're going down, Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:58.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have way more fun than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.63,0:22:04.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm a professional. I'll cry on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.17,0:22:07.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.08,0:22:14.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.17,0:22:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:24:01.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,388.8)}{\an7}My Enchanted Armor
